@CaptureTheFlag.Web_HostAddress = http://localhost:5096

### Swagger UI (Development)
GET {{CaptureTheFlag.Web_HostAddress}}/swagger/index.html

### List games
GET {{CaptureTheFlag.Web_HostAddress}}/api/games
Accept: application/json

### Get game by id
GET {{CaptureTheFlag.Web_HostAddress}}/api/games/1
Accept: application/json

### Create game
POST {{CaptureTheFlag.Web_HostAddress}}/api/games
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Status: Created -> WaitingForPlayers (required before device or admin registration)
POST {{CaptureTheFlag.Web_HostAddress}}/api/games/1/status/waiting-for-players

### Register device on admin API (only when game is WaitingForPlayers)
POST {{CaptureTheFlag.Web_HostAddress}}/api/games/1/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerName": "Alpha"
}

### Register second device
POST {{CaptureTheFlag.Web_HostAddress}}/api/games/1/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerName": "Bravo"
}

### Status: WaitingForPlayers -> InProgress (assigns teams / device ids / scores; sets StartTime)
POST {{CaptureTheFlag.Web_HostAddress}}/api/games/1/status/in-progress

### Player info for device (camelCase JSON; use database device row id from registration response)
GET {{CaptureTheFlag.Web_HostAddress}}/api/games/1/devices/1/player-info
Accept: application/json

### Status: InProgress -> Finished (sets EndTime)
POST {{CaptureTheFlag.Web_HostAddress}}/api/games/1/status/finished

### Delete game
DELETE {{CaptureTheFlag.Web_HostAddress}}/api/games/1

### --- Device API (ESP32 / IGameHttpClient), relative to same host ---

### GET current game (status 0-3, players always an array)
GET {{CaptureTheFlag.Web_HostAddress}}/api/game
Accept: application/json

### POST register (200 { "deviceId": <byte> }; game must be WaitingForPlayers)
POST {{CaptureTheFlag.Web_HostAddress}}/api/game/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerName": "Sarah"
}

### POST combat (200 empty body when ok)
POST {{CaptureTheFlag.Web_HostAddress}}/api/game/combat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "winnerId": 1,
  "loserId": 2,
  "loserHadKey": false
}

### POST deliver (key optional; Base64 when present)
POST {{CaptureTheFlag.Web_HostAddress}}/api/game/deliver
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": 1,
  "key": "AQID"
}

### GET respawn (200 { "deviceId", "combatScore" })
GET {{CaptureTheFlag.Web_HostAddress}}/api/game/respawn/1
Accept: application/json

###
